  data: {
    LLM: "Two phases. Phase 1: Two-player tricks; player to dealer's left leads, next player plays; higher card wins; no follow suit; after playing, each draws from stock to keep three cards. Equal cards (stunsa): cards stay, both draw, same leader leads again. Option: turn up top card of stock and play it. Last card of stock sets trump for phase 2. Phase 2: Player who drew trump leads; must beat previous card (higher same suit or any trump) or pick it up; trick complete when as many cards as active players; completer leads next or player to left if out.",
    Player: "Two phases. Phase 1: Two-player tricks; player to dealer's left leads, next player plays; higher card wins; no follow suit; after playing, each draws from stock to keep three cards. Equal cards (stunsa): cards stay, both draw, same leader leads again. Option: turn up top card of stock and play it. Last card of stock sets trump for phase 2. Phase 2: Player who drew trump leads; must beat previous card (higher same suit or any trump) or pick it up; trick complete when as many cards as active players; completer leads next or player to left if out.",
    objective: 'Avoid being the last player with cards in phase 2; the last player left with cards is the loser (the skitgubbe).',
    gameplay: "Two phases. Phase 1: Two-player tricks; player to dealer's left leads, next player plays; higher card wins; no follow suit; after playing, each draws from stock to keep three cards. Equal cards (stunsa): cards stay, both draw, same leader leads again. Option: turn up top card of stock and play it. Last card of stock sets trump for phase 2. Phase 2: Player who drew trump leads; must beat previous card (higher same suit or any trump) or pick it up; trick complete when as many cards as active players; completer leads next or player to left if out.",
    keyRules: [
      'Phase 1: Two-card tricks, higher rank wins, draw from stock after playing.',
      'Phase 2: Beat or pick up; follow suit when beating; trump beats non-trump.',
      'Last card of stock determines trump; holder leads phase 2.',
